{
  "description": "Internal alterations including reinstatement of the original entrance from the common stair hall to the rear principal room and reinstatement of a doorway between the front and rear principal rooms; installation of replacement chimneypieces and joinery, applied panel mouldings and dado to the Drawing Room, and fan-coil units within joinery cases; remodelling of modern partitions at both floor levels; alterations to door openings within structural walls and rationalisation of structural openings at lower ground floor level, including reinstatement of the blocked opening between Bedroom 3 and the Hall; installation of a replacement staircase within the rear volume; relocation of meters within the Lift Room to a fire-rated cabinet; and installation of a new heating and cooling system comprising an independent gas boiler within the vault plantroom, radiators, trench heaters, underfloor heating and an air-source heat pump within front Vault 3 serving fan-coil units.  (Linked to 26/07904/FULL)\r\r",
